{"unit_id":"KeLearns__dsh-navigation-bar#card-zh","repo":"KeLearns/dsh-navigation-bar","commit":"9592ab28c0e6f627ff497a38c18933b84d6dc37e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-navigation-bar 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的会话导航插件。它通过 DSH 的 shell.overlay 界面槽在当前会话旁显示钢琴键式消息索引，每根键对应一条用户消息；悬停可查看该轮用户内容和模型回复摘要，点击即可平滑滚动到对应消息。导航会随会话快照更新并标出当前视口对应的消息，提供深浅主题适配、相邻键悬停阶梯和长回复截断预览。适合需要在长对话中快速浏览、定位上下文的 DSH Web 用户；不需要额外配置或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:236-255","lib/client.js:522-550","lib/client.js:565-600"]}
{"unit_id":"KeLearns__dsh-navigation-bar#card-en","repo":"KeLearns/dsh-navigation-bar","commit":"9592ab28c0e6f627ff497a38c18933b84d6dc37e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-navigation-bar adds piano-key navigation to DSH Web chats. Each user message gets a key; hover to preview its turn and click to scroll there. The bar tracks the current message and supports light and dark themes. It helps locate context in long chats and needs no extra setup.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:236-255","lib/client.js:522-550","lib/client.js:565-600"]}
